223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The standard fundamentally removed the black box of insurance accounting. It changed how insurance companies report their financial results, requiring them to measure and disclose the value of future obligations in a consistent and transparent way. For Mauritius - now an important International Financial Centre - this meant local actuarial expertise had to operate at a global level, supporting insurers that manage risks across multiple jurisdictions.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
