<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Either way, you are filled with mixed emotions: happy, worried, and excited. And if you are an introvert like me, you are probably also apprehensive about the socialising part. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (You worry about whether people will accept you as you are, or whether you will need to adopt a new personality - your work alter ego. Smiling all the time, trying hard not to sound like an idiot, and most importantly, fitting in.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
