<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (As initiatives such as the African Continental Free Trade Area \(AfCFTA\) mature, the continent requires a unified risk infrastructure. The next 25 years will see the rise of regional actuarial hubs that harmonise risk standards across the continent, moving beyond localised manual reporting toward sophisticated, Pan-African solvency models.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
