/E (Lower Six was the first time I ever heard the word "actuary" from my accounts teacher, who told me to look it up after noticing my passion for numbers. I remember quietly questioning whether actuarial science was the right path, challenging enough, curious enough, for me. Taking it up as my degree, I never quite noticed when I surrendered to the formulae, the models, and the late nights. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9]
>>
